            {"question":"A family is struggling emotionally after the death of a loved one. According to the lecture, the MOST appropriate nursing action is to:","options":["Avoid further contact","Provide bereavement support and follow-up","Focus only on paperwork","Refer only to financial services"],"answer":"Provide bereavement support and follow-up"},
