            {"question":"The postgraduate geriatric education program in Egypt includes:","options":["Master's and doctorate degrees in geriatric medicine","Bachelor's and diploma degrees only","Nursing diploma and doctorate only","Physical therapy diploma only"],"answer":"Master's and doctorate degrees in geriatric medicine"},
