            {"question":"Which of the following is associated with postural instability?","options":["Loss of postural reflexes","Increased facial expression","Increased spontaneous movement","High-frequency tremor"],"answer":"Loss of postural reflexes"},
            {"question":"A patient has poor balance, a shuffling gait, and moves the head and body forward as one unit. These findings are most consistent with:","options":["Bradykinesia","Postural instability","Resting tremor","Hypomimia"],"answer":"Postural instability"},
