            {"question":"Why can Parkinson's disease be difficult to diagnose?","options":["It produces no neurological symptoms.","Many of its symptoms are shared with other disorders.","It affects only the peripheral nervous system.","It has no characteristic symptoms."],"answer":"Many of its symptoms are shared with other disorders."},
            {"question":"Which drug belongs to the dopaminergic class?","options":["Artane","Levodopa","Acetylcholine","Carbidopa-free therapy"],"answer":"Levodopa"},
