            {"question":"Which medication is identified as an anti-seizure drug in the OA treatment section?","options":["Pregabalin","Diclofenac","Aspirin","Acetaminophen"],"answer":"Pregabalin"},
            {"question":"A local steroid injection may be given primarily to:","options":["Increase joint deformity","Reduce inflammation and pain in a joint","Increase joint-space narrowing","Cause muscle spasm"],"answer":"Reduce inflammation and pain in a joint"},
