            {"question":"Which dietary approach is listed under primary prevention—health promotion?","options":["High protein, calcium, vitamins and minerals, and Omega-3 fatty acids","Low protein and low calcium","Elimination of vitamins and minerals","High-fat diet without other recommendations"],"answer":"High protein, calcium, vitamins and minerals, and Omega-3 fatty acids"},
